## 🛡️ 自动监控机制

### 检测脚本
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Git质量门禁监控脚本
check_git_hooks() {
    if [ ! -x ".git/hooks/pre-commit" ]; then
        echo "🚨 CRITICAL: pre-commit hook被禁用！"
        echo "🔧 自动恢复中..."
        mv .git/hooks/pre-commit.disabled .git/hooks/pre-commit 2>/dev/null || true
        chmod +x .git/hooks/pre-commit
    fi

    if [ ! -x ".git/hooks/commit-msg" ]; then
        echo "🚨 CRITICAL: commit-msg hook被禁用！"
        echo "🔧 自动恢复中..."
        mv .git/hooks/commit-msg.disabled .git/hooks/commit-msg 2>/dev/null || true
        chmod +x .git/hooks/commit-msg
    fi
}
```

### 定期检查
- 每次打开项目自动检查
